: "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18373, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MreUsp2kWooGQH39Hripsn", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18373, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01N3TKks8pbeFCu6aJARK2U9", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18673, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01N3TKks8pbeFCu6aJARK2U9", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18673, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01N3TKks8pbeFCu6aJARK2U9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 22793, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011HNJd2EcFBrPjv1SxVFi58", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the v2.3.1 deploy, checkout-api failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. Note that v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway (orchestrator error after us-east), which left the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback. All regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53393, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011HNJd2EcFBrPjv1SxVFi58", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53393, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011HNJd2EcFBrPjv1SxVFi58", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54487, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018pFoZEdFDDDEqJwVF7fkrX", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54787, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018pFoZEdFDDDEqJwVF7fkrX", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54787, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018pFoZEdFDDDEqJwVF7fkrX", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59406, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release that had been healthy in production. It had already run healthy there, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- The first rollback stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions.\n- I retried and it finished. All regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to open it timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so there's no duplicate. It's **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api, open), and creating it paged the on-call engineer.\n\nThe incident lists two things to follow up:\n- **Why v2.3.1 failed:** the release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging, so it was promoted to production despite failing there.\n- **Why the orchestrator error stopped the first rollback.**", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0154MtYURK6UsHpHTMKhznaj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0173jkg4EdVvpedPAdFFFRcf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RycXpuavn3zT69T8h6J9ba", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Ts7bE6WQUf6ksjjpJxW1gg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Partial rollback: only us-east is on v2.3.0. Retrying the rollback to finish the remaining regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01USisLBESLP5gBK12xHuGpo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MreUsp2kWooGQH39Hripsn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01N3TKks8pbeFCu6aJARK2U9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011HNJd2EcFBrPjv1SxVFi58", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the v2.3.1 deploy, checkout-api failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. Note that v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway (orchestrator error after us-east), which left the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback. All regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018pFoZEdFDDDEqJwVF7fkrX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release that had been healthy in production. It had already run healthy there, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- The first rollback stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions.\n- I retried and it finished. All regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to open it timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so there's no duplicate. It's **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api, open), and creating it paged the on-call engineer.\n\nThe incident lists two things to follow up:\n- **Why v2.3.1 failed:** the release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging, so it was promoted to production despite failing there.\n- **Why the orchestrator error stopped the first rollback.**", "type": "text"}]}]}